        "summary": "Compound 1 shows weak antiferromagnetic Gd···Gd coupling and a magnetocaloric effect. χMT is nearly constant from 300–25 K then falls to 16.35 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K; a dinuclear Hamiltonian fit gives J = −0.15 cm−1 and g = 2.01. Magnetization saturates at 28.10 Nβ (2 K, 80 kOe). Maximum −ΔSm = 29.91 J K−1 kg−1 at 2.0 K and ΔH = 7 T (expected 33.63 J K−1 kg−1).",
