        "summary": "Compound 2 shows χMT = 56.66 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K, decreasing to 49.04 cm3 K mol−1 at 50 K (Stark depopulation) and 24.25 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K, consistent with weak antiferromagnetic Dy···Dy interactions. Zero-field ac susceptibility (3 Oe, 111–1311 Hz, 2–20 K) shows no clear frequency-dependent in-phase signal; out-of-phase χ″ is frequency-dependent at low T but no maximum is observed above 2 K, so SMM behaviour is only tentatively suggested.",
